m negative; investor cycle failed (broke its start low); last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 13 \u00b7 failed \u00b7 daily cycle broke its start low 11d ago).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): unconfirmed turn. Bigger picture (counter-trend): bearish.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is bearish (counter-trend for a daily long)", "Macro: US net liquidity neutral \u2014 no macro tilt on the odds", "\u26a0 Failed cycle \u2014 price broke below the low that began this cycle (11d ago)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average", "Daily momentum just crossed up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "UNCONFIRMED \u2014 HIGH RISK", "tag_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4 \u2014 \u9ad8\u98ce\u9669", "urgency": "caution", "text": "An unconfirmed turn: a daily low is forming while the bigger picture is still bearish. Nimble traders only \u2014 small size, defined stop below 28.56. Not an investment buy until the weekly confirms; most of these fail, a minority start a new cycle.", "text_zh": "\u672a\u786e\u8ba4\u8f6c\u5411\uff1a\u65e5\u7ebf\u4f4e\u70b9\u6b63\u5728\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u4f46\u5927\u5c40\u4ecd\u504f\u7a7a\u3002\u4ec5\u9650\u7075\u6d3b\u4ea4\u6613\u8005\u2014\u2014\u5c0f\u4ed3\u4f4d\u3001\u6b62\u635f\u8bbe\u4e8e 28.56 \u4e0b\u65b9\u3002\u5728\u5468\u7ebf\u786e\u8ba4\u524d\u5e76\u975e\u6295\u8d44\u6027\u4e70\u5165\uff1b\u591a\u6570\u6700\u7ec8\u5931\u8d25\uff0c\u5c11\u6570\u5219\u5f00\u542f\u65b0\u5468\u671f\u3002"}, "cycle_plain": {"daily_line": "Daily cycle: day 58 of a typical 36\u201342 trading days", "daily_phase": "overdue \u2014 past the typical window, so a low could form any day", "daily_line_zh": "\u65e5\u7ebf\u5468\u671f\uff1a\u7b2c 58 \u5929\uff0c\u5178\u578b\u5468\u671f\u4e3a 36\u201342 \u4e2a\u4ea4\u6613\u65e5", "daily_phase_zh": "\u903e\u671f\u2014\u2014\u5df2\u8d85\u8fc7\u5178\u578b\u7a97\u53e3\uff0c\u4f4e\u70b9\u968f\u6